---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Technology — Conatus Real Estate"
  description="Custom-built platforms, AI-powered analysis workflows, Claude Code development practices, and responsible AI — how Conatus Real Estate builds technology."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <p class="page-label">Technology</p>
      <h1>Tools that create<br /><span class="accent">structural advantage</span></h1>

      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">
          We build and deploy purpose-built technology to streamline every phase of
          real estate operations — from market analysis to portfolio management.
          Every system leverages Claude's intelligence as core infrastructure.
        </p>

        <h2>Custom-Built Investor Portal</h2>
        <p>
          Rather than relying on off-the-shelf SaaS, we build custom platforms
          tailored to specific operational requirements. Our investor portal
          integrates acquisitions pipeline management, portfolio analytics, and
          compliance tracking into a unified system designed for the way operators
          actually work.
        </p>
        <p>
          These aren't prototypes — they're production systems that have executed
          4,000+ SFR transactions and managed $1B+ in acquisitions capital.
        </p>

        <h2>AI-Powered Analysis Workflows</h2>
        <p>
          We use Claude to power analysis workflows that would otherwise require
          significant manual effort. Market research, comparable analysis, due
          diligence preparation, document processing, and compliance review are
          all enhanced through AI-driven pipelines.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every AI-powered workflow maintains human oversight. Claude processes and
          surfaces insights; humans review and decide. This isn't a philosophical
          position — it's an operational requirement in regulated industries.
        </p>

        <h2>Claude Code & AI-Native Development</h2>
        <p>
          Our development practice is AI-native. We use Claude Code daily as our
          primary development tool — building custom platforms, writing and reviewing
          code, and shipping production systems. This isn't occasional AI assistance;
          it's how we build software.
        </p>
        <p>
          Key patterns in our development workflow:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>MCP Tool Definitions</strong> — Custom tool definitions that give Claude structured access to operational data, enabling context-aware analysis and automation.</li>
          <li><strong>Autonomous Agent Workflows</strong> — Multi-step workflows that execute complex analysis, development, and review tasks with built-in quality gates.</li>
          <li><strong>AI-Driven Pipelines</strong> — Automated data processing, underwriting analysis, and compliance document review powered by Claude.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Development Orchestrator</h2>
        <p>
          We've built a custom orchestrator that manages AI-driven development at
          scale. It handles task decomposition, autonomous agent execution, quality
          gates and approval workflows, context management, and iterative
          improvement across codebases.
        </p>
        <p>
          The orchestrator enables consistent, production-grade output across complex
          projects — from single-file fixes to multi-system refactoring. It's the same
          system that built and maintains the platforms we deliver to clients.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Infrastructure</h2>
        <p>
          Clean data is the foundation of good decisions. We build data pipelines
          that aggregate property data, market indicators, and portfolio metrics
          into unified views that enable fast, confident decision-making.
        </p>

        <h2>Responsible AI</h2>
        <p>
          We believe AI should be powerful and accountable. Our approach to AI in
          real estate operations:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Human oversight on all recommendations</strong> — AI surfaces analysis and insights. Humans make the decisions. Every recommendation generated by AI is reviewed before action is taken.</li>
          <li><strong>Transparent to clients</strong> — When AI is part of a process, we say so. Clients understand what's automated and what's human-reviewed.</li>
          <li><strong>Compliant with California real estate disclosure requirements</strong> — All AI-assisted processes are designed to meet applicable regulatory requirements, including CA DRE disclosure standards.</li>
          <li><strong>No black boxes</strong> — We can explain how our AI workflows reach their outputs. Audit trails are built into every pipeline.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Open Source Philosophy</h2>
        <p>
          Where possible, we contribute tooling and methodology back to the
          community. We believe that transparency in our approach builds trust
          and drives the industry forward.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
</style>
